{"id":"95643c507a4d6dc3","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-substitution-function.md","title":"数码代入的编码函数","display":"df-substitution-function — 数码代入的编码函数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-substitution-function","aliases":["91-df-substitution-function","91-df-coded-substitution"],"display":"df-substitution-function — 数码代入的编码函数","depends_on":["[[91-df-ground-language]]","[[91-df-language-with-truth]]","[[91-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-substitution-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-substitution-function</span><span>91-df-coded-substitution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-substitution-function — 数码代入的编码函数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2ad7561edabb2148\" href=\"?note=2ad7561edabb2148\" title=\"91-df-ground-language\">91-df-ground-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"97fe560478d37064\" href=\"?note=97fe560478d37064\" title=\"91-df-language-with-truth\">91-df-language-with-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"822ef14bbd4e020d\" href=\"?note=822ef14bbd4e020d\" title=\"91-df-numeral\">91-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\\in\\{\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L_T\\}\">\\(\\mathcal L\\in\\{\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L_T\\}\\)</span> (有效给出的一阶语言)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> (指定变量)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_{\\mathcal L}:\\operatorname{Expr}(\\mathcal L)\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(g_{\\mathcal L}:\\operatorname{Expr}(\\mathcal L)\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>\n(单射 Gödel 编码，记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_{\\mathcal L}(\\xi)=\\ulcorner\\xi\\urcorner\">\\(g_{\\mathcal L}(\\xi)=\\ulcorner\\xi\\urcorner\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PRCode}_{\\mathcal L}(g_{\\mathcal L})\">\\(\\operatorname{PRCode}_{\\mathcal L}(g_{\\mathcal L})\\)</span>\n(句法构造与解码测试对该编码均为原始递归)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline n\">\\(\\overline n\\)</span> (自然数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的对象语言数字, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"822ef14bbd4e020d\" href=\"?note=822ef14bbd4e020d\" title=\"91-df-numeral\">91-df-numeral</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi[\\overline n/x]\">\\(\\varphi[\\overline n/x]\\)</span> (把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 的自由出现无捕获地替换为\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline n\">\\(\\overline n\\)</span> 的元层句法运算)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L^{\\mathrm{pr}}\">\\(\\mathcal L^{\\mathrm{pr}}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^{\\mathrm{pr}}\">\\(S^{\\mathrm{pr}}\\)</span>\n(为原始递归函数加入规范函数符号的定义性扩张语言与背景理论)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L,x}\n\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L}\\mid\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\},\n\\qquad\ne_{\\bot}\\coloneqq\\ulcorner 0=1\\urcorner.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L,x}\n\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L}\\mid\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\},\n\\qquad\ne_{\\bot}\\coloneqq\\ulcorner 0=1\\urcorner.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>编码层的总函数定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{x}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{x}(e,n)\n\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\ulcorner\\varphi[\\overline n/x]\\urcorner,\n&amp;\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L,x}\\,\n(e=\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner),\\\\\ne_{\\bot},\n&amp;e\\notin\n\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\mid\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L,x}\\}.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{x}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{x}(e,n)\n\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\ulcorner\\varphi[\\overline n/x]\\urcorner,\n&amp;\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L,x}\\,\n(e=\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner),\\\\\ne_{\\bot},\n&amp;e\\notin\n\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\mid\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L,x}\\}.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>编码的单射性使第一分支中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 唯一；并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PRCode}_{\\mathcal L}(g_{\\mathcal L})\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{x}\\in\\operatorname{PR}_2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PRCode}_{\\mathcal L}(g_{\\mathcal L})\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{x}\\in\\operatorname{PR}_2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>在定义性扩张中，以\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{x}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{x}\\)</span> 表示该元函数的规范对象语言函数\n符号，即</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall e,n\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\nS^{\\mathrm{pr}}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{x}(\\overline e,\\overline n)\n=\n\\overline{\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{x}(e,n)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall e,n\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\nS^{\\mathrm{pr}}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{x}(\\overline e,\\overline n)\n=\n\\overline{\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{x}(e,n)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对互异变量元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\">\\(\\vec x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\)</span>，同步数码代入项约定为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{\\langle\\rangle}(e)\n&amp;\\coloneqq e,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)}\n(e,n_1,\\ldots,n_k)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{x_k}\\!\\left(\n\\cdots\n\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{x_1}(e,n_1)\n\\cdots,n_k\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{\\langle\\rangle}(e)\n&amp;\\coloneqq e,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)}\n(e,n_1,\\ldots,n_k)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{x_k}\\!\\left(\n\\cdots\n\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{x_1}(e,n_1)\n\\cdots,n_k\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>小写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{x}\">\\(\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{x}\\)</span> 是元层自然数函数；大写\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{x}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{x}\\)</span> 是表示它的对象语言函数符号。\n上下文固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> 时省略语言上标。\n因此，对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(x)\">\\(\\varphi(x)\\)</span>，对象公式中应写</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T\\!\\left(\n\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{x}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},n)\n\\right),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T\\!\\left(\n\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{x}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},n)\n\\right),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>不能把未命名的元层数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\)</span> 直接当作项。因为代入\n项是闭数码，逐个代入互异变量不会捕获自由变量，所以上述复合给出所需\n的同步代入编码。</p>\n<p>本节点采用与\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7279c20158ac140e\" href=\"?note=7279c20158ac140e\" title=\"../90/90-df-substitution-function.md\">90-df-substitution-function</a>\n相同的“合法输入重编码、非法输入取固定默认码”的总函数模式，并补出\n第 91 本书实际使用的对象语言代表符号与多变量记号。它不把“有效可算”\n自动提升为“原始递归”；后者由\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PRCode}_{\\mathcal L}(g_{\\mathcal L})\">\\(\\operatorname{PRCode}_{\\mathcal L}(g_{\\mathcal L})\\)</span> 明确承担。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-ground-language","status":"resolved","id":"2ad7561edabb2148","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-ground-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-language-with-truth","status":"resolved","id":"97fe560478d37064","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-language-with-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"822ef14bbd4e020d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"822ef14bbd4e020d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\overline n$ (自然数 $n$ 的对象语言数字, see [[91-df-numeral]])","embed":false},{"target":"../90/90-df-substitution-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"7279c20158ac140e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"本节点采用与\n[[../90/90-df-substitution-function.md|90-df-substitution-function]]\n相同的“合法输入重编码、非法输入取固定默认码”的总函数模式，并补出\n第 91 本书实际使用的对象语言代表符号与多变量记号。它不把“有效可算”\n自动提升为“原始递归”；后者由\n$\\operatorname{PRCode}_{\\mathcal L}(g_{\\mathcal L})$ 明确承担。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L\\in\\{\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L_T\\}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"g_{\\mathcal L}:\\operatorname{Expr}(\\mathcal L)\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"g_{\\mathcal L}(\\xi)=\\ulcorner\\xi\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PRCode}_{\\mathcal L}(g_{\\mathcal L})","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi[\\overline n/x]","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L^{\\mathrm{pr}}","display":false},{"tex":"S^{\\mathrm{pr}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L,x}\n\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L}\\mid\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\},\n\\qquad\ne_{\\bot}\\coloneqq\\ulcorner 0=1\\urcorner.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{x}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{x}(e,n)\n\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\ulcorner\\varphi[\\overline n/x]\\urcorner,\n&\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L,x}\\,\n(e=\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner),\\\\\ne_{\\bot},\n&e\\notin\n\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\mid\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L,x}\\}.\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PRCode}_{\\mathcal L}(g_{\\mathcal L})\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{x}\\in\\operatorname{PR}_2.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{x}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall e,n\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\nS^{\\mathrm{pr}}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{x}(\\overline e,\\overline n)\n=\n\\overline{\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{x}(e,n)}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\vec x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{\\langle\\rangle}(e)\n&\\coloneqq e,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)}\n(e,n_1,\\ldots,n_k)\n&\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{x_k}\\!\\left(\n\\cdots\n\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{x_1}(e,n_1)\n\\cdots,n_k\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{x}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{x}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(x)","display":false},{"tex":"T\\!\\left(\n\\operatorname{Sub}^{\\mathcal L}_{x}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},n)\n\\right),","display":true},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PRCode}_{\\mathcal L}(g_{\\mathcal L})","display":false}],"bytes":3694,"backlinks":[{"id":"b0b2a8b496dd82c3","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Sub}_x(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\theta\\urcorner},n)$ (数字代入后的句子编码项,\nsee [[91-df-substitution-function]])"},{"id":"b31ce2c72a177855","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Sub}_x(a,n)$ (捕获规避地代入数字后的编码函数,\nsee [[91-df-substitution-function]])"},{"id":"ec1d9c6fcc3c0767","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"25c37fe51095276d","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Sub}_x$ (捕获规避的数字代